The trip plan satisfies all constraints and uses only direct flights between the cities. The itinerary is as follows:

- Start in Reykjavik for 2 days (Day 1-2).
- Fly to Vienna on Day 2 (flight day counted in both Reykjavik and Vienna), stay in Vienna for 2 days (Day 2-3), covering the show on Day 2-3.
- Fly to Helsinki on Day 3 (flight day counted in both Vienna and Helsinki), stay in Helsinki for 3 days (Day 3-5), meeting friends between Day 3-5.
- Fly to Riga on Day 5 (flight day counted in both Helsinki and Riga), stay in Riga for 3 days (Day 5-7).
- Fly to Tallinn on Day 7 (flight day counted in both Riga and Tallinn), stay in Tallinn for 5 days (Day 7-11), attending the wedding between Day 7-11.
- Fly to Dublin on Day 11 (flight day counted in both Tallinn and Dublin), stay in Dublin for 5 days (Day 11-15).

All direct flights used are valid based on the provided connections. The JSON output below lists the city visits with their day ranges, including the flight days in both the departure and arrival cities, without separate flight entries.

